('AI', 'Which company, founded by Elon Musk, makes the AI chatbot Grok?', '', 'Neuralink', 'OpenAI', 'نيورالينك (Neuralink)', 'أوبن إيه آي (OpenAI)'),
('AI', 'What does "LLM" stand for, the type of AI behind chatbots like ChatGPT?', '', 'Large learning machine', 'Language logic model', 'آلة تعلّم كبيرة (Large learning machine)', 'نموذج منطق اللغة (Language logic model)'),
