('AI', 'What does "GPU" stand for, the type of computer chip most used to train AI?', '', 'General processing unit', 'Graphical power unit', 'وحدة المعالجة العامة (General processing unit)', 'وحدة طاقة الرسوميات (Graphical power unit)'),
('AI', 'Which tech boss, famous for his black leather jacket, co-founded Nvidia?', '', 'Sam Altman', 'Tim Cook', 'سام ألتمان', 'تيم كوك');
