('Egyptians', 'In the play "El Eyal Kebret", how many children does the father have?', '', '3', '5', '3', '5'),
('Egyptians', 'In "El Kebir Awi", what is the name of El Kebir''s wife, played by Donia Samir Ghanem?', '', 'Fawzeya', 'Nabaweya', 'فوزية', 'نبوية'),
('Egyptians', 'Which 1968 comedy, based on a Youssef El-Sebai novel, follows a clerk who buys pills of good and bad morals from a strange shop?', '', 'Ard El Salam', 'Bein El Atlal', 'أرض السلام', 'بين الأطلال'),
('Egyptians', 'Which actor created and starred as Wanees, a father determined to raise his children on good values, in the 1994 series "Yawmeyat Wanees"?', '', 'Yehia El Fakharany', 'Fouad El-Mohandes', 'يحيى الفخراني', 'فؤاد المهندس'),
('Egyptians', 'In which 1985 comedy play does a man on the run hide in a rich family''s house, where his uncle is the cook, and end up as the daughter''s stand-in husband?', '', 'El Zaeem', 'Bodyguard', 'الزعيم', 'بودي جارد'),
('Egyptians', 'Complete the Egyptian proverb, said when someone ruins what they tried to fix: "Gah yekahhalha ..." ("He came to put kohl on her eyes ...")', '', 'Ayyatha', 'Garahha', 'عيطها', 'جرحها'),
('Egyptians', 'Which 1975 film, based on a Naguib Mahfouz novel, is named after the Cairo cafe whose young regulars are arrested by the secret police?', '', 'Miramar', 'Thartharah Fawq El Nil', 'ميرامار', 'ثرثرة فوق النيل'),
('Egyptians', 'Which actor played Saladin in Youssef Chahine''s 1963 epic "El Nasser Salah El Din"?', '', 'Rushdy Abaza', 'Salah Zulfikar', 'رشدي أباظة', 'صلاح ذو الفقار'),
('Egyptians', 'Which Egyptian actress of the 1950s and 60s was nicknamed "the Marilyn Monroe of the East"?', '', 'Nadia Lutfi', 'Shams El Baroudi', 'نادية لطفي', 'شمس البارودي'),
('Egyptians', 'Complete the Egyptian proverb, meaning old habits never die: "Yemoot el-zammar ..." ("The piper dies ...")', '', 'W''nafaso fel-zammara', 'W''albo beyghanni', 'ونفسه في الزمارة', 'وقلبه بيغني'),
