('Egyptians', 'In the 1957 comedy "Ibn Hamido", the fishermen''s chief Hanafi boasts that his word never falls to the ground, then gives in to his wife. What famous phrase does he say?', '', '"Khalas, ma''lesh el-marra di"', '"Khalas, ala keifek el-marra di"', '"خلاص، معلش المرة دي"', '"خلاص، على كيفك المرة دي"'),
('Egyptians', 'Complete the Egyptian proverb, said about someone who has no luck: "Get el-hazina tefrah ..." ("The sad woman came to be happy ...")', '', 'Ma la''etlahash farah', 'Ma la''etsh had', 'ما لقيتلهاش فرح', 'ما لقيتش حد'),
('Egyptians', 'Complete the Egyptian proverb, a warning against marrying for money: "Ya wakhed el-erd ala malo ..." ("You who take the monkey for its money ...")', '', 'Yerooh el-mal w''yehrab el-erd', 'Yerooh el-mal w''yerooh el-erd', 'يروح المال ويهرب القرد', 'يروح المال ويروح القرد'),
('Egyptians', 'What was the name of the 1960s comedy trio of Samir Ghanem, George Sidhom and El-Deif Ahmed?', '', 'Tholathy El Nogoum', 'Tholathy El Kawakeb', 'ثلاثي النجوم', 'ثلاثي الكواكب'),
('Egyptians', 'The TV spy hero Raafat El-Haggan was based on a real Egyptian agent who lived undercover in Israel. What was the agent''s real name?', '', 'Ahmed El-Hawan', 'Saleh Morsi', 'أحمد الهوان', 'صالح مرسي'),
('Egyptians', 'In Youssef Chahine''s "El Nasser Salah El Din" (1963), which actor plays Issa El-Awam, Saladin''s officer who falls in love with a Crusader woman?', '', 'Hamdy Gheith', 'Rushdy Abaza', 'حمدي غيث', 'رشدي أباظة'),
('Egyptians', 'In "Madrasat El Moshaghebeen", what is the first name of the teacher, played by Soheir El-Babli, who finally tames the troublemakers?', '', 'Nadia', 'Sanaa', 'نادية', 'سناء'),
('Egyptians', 'In the series "Raafat El Haggan", what name does Raafat use while living undercover in Israel?', '', 'Daniel Moshe Levy', 'Jack Victor Cohen', 'دانيال موشيه ليفي', 'جاك فيكتور كوهين'),
('Egyptians', 'Which actor, who played hundreds of roles, was nicknamed "Shareer El Shasha" (the Villain of the Screen) and "the Anthony Quinn of the East"?', '', 'Farid Shawqi', 'Tawfik El Deken', 'فريد شوقي', 'توفيق الدقن'),
('Egyptians', 'Which 1980 spy series tells the story of Gomaa El Shawan, an Egyptian double agent who fooled Israel''s Mossad?', '', 'Raafat El Haggan', 'Mohemma fi Tel Aviv', 'رأفت الهجان', 'مهمة في تل أبيب'),
('Egyptians', 'Complete the Egyptian proverb, about a mother who scolds her son but will not let others wish him harm: "Ad''i ala ebni ..." ("I pray against my son ...")', '', 'W''arga'' ad''ilo', 'W''a''ool ya rab ma testegib', 'وأرجع أدعيله', 'وأقول يا رب ما تستجيب');
